# Copy to .env.local (gitignored, never committed) and fill in real values.
# Sourced by .claude/launch.json before starting liquidgov_http.

# YouTube Data API v3 key. Do NOT put this in HTML — a previous client
# embed leaked it to every logged-in page. Rotate any key that has ever
# been shipped to a browser (Google Cloud Console → Credentials →
# delete/regenerate). Search-as-you-type is off until a server-side
# /jukebox/search proxy exists; paste-a-link still queues a track.
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
